		"description": "<p>1 Action, Reach: 8. Remove Soul Touched from the target and choose 1 of the following effects. If Soul Touched wasn’t removed, this does nothing:</p><ul><li><strong>Meekness.</strong> Target is Dazed, 2 turns.</li><li><strong>Corrupt.</strong> Enemy is Impaired, 2 turns. Choose the condition. While Impaired this way, they lose any resistances.</li></ul><hr><p><em>[A] Grants two separate Rite features — Suffering Rite: Meekness and Suffering Rite: Corrupt. Each checks and removes your Soul Touched on the target.</em></p><p><em>[M] Characters created before this update: delete and re-add Suffering Rites to receive them.</em></p>",
